T=4,INQUIRE=5,FAILED=6,YEILD=7  Compile Process:  javac client.java  javac Project2.java javac checker.java  Run:  java Project2 n    n being the server number in testconfig file java client n    n being the server number in testconfig file and this is the application where the routine can be changed only the cs_enter cs_exit and connection1 with a small file read script will remain the same.  there is also launcher scripts which can be used launcher_server.sh and launcher_clients.sh which can be used to automate the run process  Error detection:  Error:001 with quorum formations - Quorum property of intersection violated Error:002 with quorum formations - Quorum property of subset violated Error:003 with quorum formations - The number of quorums in which each process is should be the same Error 004:Error writing to the file Error 005:Error writing to the file, position not correct Error 006:Error reading file Error 007:James Bond error, Multiple access to Critical Section Error 008:Error reading config file","topics":[],"score":1822,"global_rank":433475},{"name":"saransh2405/Barrel-Race-Android-Game","owner":"saransh2405","html_url":"https://github.com/saransh2405/Barrel-Race-Android-Game","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"A small game ","topics":[],"score":1822,"global_rank":433476},{"name":"saransh2405/LibrarySystemManagement","owner":"saransh2405","html_url":"https://github.com/saransh2405/LibrarySystemManagement","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"Simple library management application","topics":[],"score":1822,"global_rank":433477},{"name":"Helithumper/APCS-Exam-Prep","owner":"Helithumper","html_url":"https://github.com/Helithumper/APCS-Exam-Prep","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"Exam Prep Study Guide","topics":[],"score":1822,"global_rank":433481},{"name":"Helithumper/Quadratic-Formula","owner":"Helithumper","html_url":"https://github.com/Helithumper/Quadratic-Formula","s